/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (Core of every move. Packs nonzero tiles toward index 0, scans left to right merging equal neighbours \(skipping the partner so a tile merges at most once\), repacks, and reports whether the line changed and the points earned.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
69 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (Apply slide_line to every row or column. Right and down copy the line in reverse, slide it, and copy it back. They return a MoveResult and never insert tiles or touch the score, so they can be tested deterministically.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
70 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
