/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 45 0 R
/T (The submission has two separate console programs written in standard C++17. game2048 is a playable 5x5 2048 with scoring, win and game-over detection, and a single-slot save/load. luhn checks whether a 16-digit number passes the Luhn checksum. A passing checksum only shows the digits are internally consistent; it does not show that a card exists or is authorized.)
